  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification of agricultural value chains with high potential for smallholders, youth and women inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PUM Netherlands senior experts are organizing a nine-day dairy sector study visit to the Netherlands for participants from Zimbabwe. RVO finances four additional participants from the ZADF (Zimbabwe Association of Dairy Farmers) and local dairy companies to the mission. The purpose of the visit is to increase the knowledge on improved Dutch dairy farming technologies and products that can help improve the dairy sector in Zimbabwe. This mission includes networking, company visits, farm visits and exchanges with educational institutes and dairy sector organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
